\title{Fredrik Bakke}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\meta{author}{false}

\p{
I am a PhD student at the Norwegian University of Science and Technology, doing
work in higher category theory and univalent type theory. I am also a
collaborator on the [[agda-synthetic-categories]] project and a maintainer of
[[agda-unimath]].
}
\p{
This is my personal page where I manage my personal notes as well as
miscellaneous exposition related to my work. The web page is written using Jon
Sterling's [Forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/005P/).
}
\p{
This forest is hosted in a public repository on GitHub:
[fredrik-bakke/forest](https://github.com/fredrik-bakke/forest).
}

\p{
You can search the forest by pressing \code{Ctrl}+\code{K}.
}
